1
00:00:00,159 --> 00:00:01,869
Yeah, they hate that.

2
00:00:04,063 --> 00:00:08,343
(Leonard:)You know what, Sheldon is the
smartest person I have ever met.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,810
(Leonard:)He's a little broken
and he needs me.

4
00:00:12,404 --> 00:00:14,074
(Leonard:)I guess I need him, too.

5
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:15,740
(Arthur:)Why is that?

6
00:00:16,508 --> 00:00:18,388
(Leonard:)Boy, you will not
let this go, will you?

7
00:00:21,246 --> 00:00:22,516
Oh, geez.

8
00:00:22,681 --> 00:00:24,251
(Arthur:)Another photo from Sheldon?

9
00:00:24,416 --> 00:00:25,756
(Leonard:)No, I have to go pick him up.

10
00:00:25,918 --> 00:00:28,158
(Leonard:)Bill Nye ditched him
at the smoothie place.

11
00:00:30,022 --> 00:00:32,192
(Arthur:)He probably stole his wallet, too.

12
00:00:37,262 --> 00:00:38,362
(Howard:)You know, if you guys are interested,

13
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:40,700
(Howard:)there's a technique
where I can take a lock of your hair,

14
00:00:40,866 --> 00:00:44,076
(Howard:)refine it into carbon dust,
and use the hydraulic press at work

15
00:00:44,236 --> 00:00:47,346
(Howard:)to turn it into a tiny little diamond
with your DNA in it.

16
00:00:47,506 --> 00:00:49,006
Oh, that's amazing!

17
00:00:49,174 --> 00:00:50,514
(Howard:)Yeah. See Bernie's engagement ring?

18
00:00:50,676 --> 00:00:53,126
(Howard:)That came right off my mom's back.

19
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:55,950
(Bernadette:)He's kidding.

20
00:00:56,115 --> 00:01:00,025
(Bernadette:)If that were true,
it'd be so much bigger.

